WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.499
Make a browser-console message. Start with the live example.

00:00:03.499 --> 00:00:08.585
Write your message. Editing stays silent.

00:00:08.585 --> 00:00:16.057
Choose a style, then compare the same words as plain text.

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:20.376
Open DevTools → Console. Test in console prints one entry.

00:00:20.376 --> 00:00:27.635
Copy the complete console.log. It runs without installing ConsoleFX.

00:00:27.635 --> 00:00:28.576
Need more control? Take the same scene into the playground.

00:00:28.576 --> 00:00:35.061
Confirm Load example. Your previous scene remains in Undo.

00:00:35.061 --> 00:00:38.309
Keep editing, with undo and a draft saved in this browser.

00:00:38.309 --> 00:00:44.148
Your complete export is ready to paste into your own code.
